@page
@{ViewData["Title"]="Shop Data Ownership";}
<partial name="_AdminNavigation" />
<div id="shop-data"><h1>Shop Data Ownership</h1><p>Masters are private by default. Sharing permits reading and use, not editing the owning shop's catalog or prices. Share a product's category and brand explicitly first.</p><div id="shop-data-message" class="alert alert-info" role="alert" hidden></div>
<form id="shop-data-form" class="card card-body"><label>Master record<select id="shop-master" class="form-select" required></select></label><label>Action<select id="shop-action" class="form-select"><option value="SHARE">Share read access</option><option value="REVOKE">Revoke read access</option><option value="RESOLVE">Resolve quarantined ownership to active shop</option></select></label><label>Target shop<select id="shop-target" class="form-select" required></select></label><label>Evidence / authorization reason<textarea id="shop-reason" class="form-control" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-dark mt-2">Save Authorized Decision</button><p class="small mt-2">Quarantined records have no inferred owner. Resolve categories and brands before products. Resolution records the explicit owner decision; it never renumbers an ID or rewrites invoices. Already allocated records cannot be reassigned here.</p></form>
<section class="card card-body mt-3"><h2>Explicit sharing</h2><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Kind</th><th>Master ID</th><th>Shared with shop</th></tr></thead><tbody id="shop-shares"></tbody></table></div><h2>Decision history</h2><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Action</th><th>Kind / ID</th><th>Source / target</th><th>Actor</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody id="shop-events"></tbody></table></div></section></div>
@section Scripts {<script src="~/js/shop-data.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>}
